OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 35, jailed for rape after
OL,4,Aprevious deportation warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA 35-year-old man has been jailed for
OL,10,Fthe rape of a woman, after being told
OL,11,Fseven years ago he would be deported
OL,12,Fonce he had served a previous sentence
OL,13,Ffor a sexual offence.
OL,15,FRadiet Meles, from Eritrea, was given
OL,16,Fan extended 13-year sentence after
OL,17,Fbeing found guilty of rape and assault
OL,18,Ffollowing an attack in Newport in
OL,19,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
